@startuml
title CFS-based delivery

participant "ProductOrderOrchestration\nManagement" as POOM
participant "ProductOrderCapture\nValidation" as POCV
participant "ProductInventory" as PI
box "Access Service Domain"
  participant "ServiceOrdering\nManagement" as SOM
  participant "ServiceInventory\nManagement" as SIM
  participant "ServiceCatalog\nManagement" as SCM
  participant "ResourceInventory" as RI
  participant "ResourceOrdering\nManagement" as ROM
  participant "ResourceCatalog\nManagement" as RCM
end box

activate POOM

== CFS-based Delivery - illustration for landline access ==

POOM -> POOM : 20 Determine requested service representation

note right of SOM : Access delivery factory

POOM -> SOM : 21 **TMF641 Service Order** POST /serviceOrder\nto add a landline access at place #
activate SOM
SOM --> POOM : 22 **TMF641** 200 OK\nService Order #51 created

note right of PI : Service delivery not performed on the fly

POOM -> PI : 23 **TMF637 Product Inventory Management** PATCH /product/id\n(state update to pendingActive)
activate PI
PI --> POOM : 24 **TMF637** 200 OK\nProduct updated
deactivate PI

POOM -> POCV : 25 **TMF622 Product Ordering** PATCH /productOrder/id1 (state item update to inProgress)
activate POCV
POCV --> POOM : 26 **TMF622** 200 OK\nProductOrder updated
deactivate POCV

group new service creation in the inventory
    SOM -> SIM : 27 **TMF638 Service Inventory Management** POST /service
    activate SIM
    SIM --> SOM : 28 **TMF638** 201 Created\nService created
    deactivate SIM
end

group Determination of the RFS Spec for the CFS Spec / Identification of existing resource(s)
    SOM -> SCM : 29 **TMF633 Service Catalog Management** GET /serviceSpecification\n(filtered for Landline Access)
    activate SCM
    SCM --> SOM : 30 **TMF633** 200 OK\nService Specification list for Landline access\nIn particular information related to RFSSpec
    deactivate SCM

    SOM -> SIM : 31 **TMF638 Service Inventory Management** GET /service\n(filtered for ServiceSpec, etc.)
    activate SIM
    SIM --> SOM : 32 **TMF638** 200 OK\nService(s) representation
    deactivate SIM

    SOM -> SOM : 33 Compute RFSSpec choice &\nidentify supporting resourceSpec

    SOM -> RCM : 34 **TMF639 Resource Inventory Management** GET /resourceSpecification/id
    activate RCM
    RCM --> SOM : 35 **TMF639** 200 OK\nResourceSpecification representation
    deactivate RCM

    SOM -> RI : 36 **TMF639 Resource Inventory Management** GET /resource\n(filtered on ResourceSpec, etc.)
    activate RI
    RI --> SOM : 37 **TMF639** 200 OK\nResource representation
    deactivate RI

    SOM -> SOM : 38 Associate CFSSpec->RFSSpec\n->Resource/ResourceSpec

    SOM -> ROM : 39 **TMF652 Resource Ordering** POST /resourceOrder
    activate ROM
    ROM --> SOM : 40 **TMF652** 201 Created\nResourceOrder created
    deactivate ROM
end
deactivate SOM
deactivate POOM

@enduml
